         <p class="caveat">(Sales figures exclude manga and superhero titles, so the true total is higher. The newest years of the database are the least complete, because volunteers tend to catalogue recent comics last.)</p>
         <p class="transition">So if Australians are not reading Australian comics, whose are they reading?</p>
